Stop publishing a service.

The name stops answering immediately, which olr reports as a
disruptive change: anyone with the URL open loses it.

Usage:
  olr ingress rm <name> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for rm

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")
